Mantap itu.

258
00:25:21,417 --> 00:25:23,208
Gerimis saja kalian istirahat.

259
00:25:24,917 --> 00:25:27,042
Di eraku, kami bekerja tiap saat,

260
00:25:27,125 --> 00:25:28,792
