334
00:31:09,667 --> 00:31:12,625
Dia tumbuh cepat sekali.

335
00:31:15,917 --> 00:31:17,667
<i>Rasanya aku melewatkan masa kecilnya.</i>

336
00:31:19,875 --> 00:31:21,125
<i>Sama.</i>

337
00:31:23,375 --> 00:31:25,417
<i>Waktu cepat sekali berlalu.</i>

338
00:31:46,292 --> 00:31:48,208
